{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07140","headline":"洞庭驿逢郴州使还寄李汤司马 · 刘长卿","name":"洞庭驿逢郴州使还寄李汤司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭秋水阔，南望过衡峰。\n远客潇湘里，归人何处逢。\n孤云飞不定，落叶去无踪。\n莫使沧浪叟，长歌笑尔容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}